{"kind": "stale-summary", "title": "Orchard depot summary needs updating to the October 2026 three-depot list", "body": "**Orchard transport depots — current as of 2026-10-15**

Transport uses three depots: North, South and East. This replaces the earlier two-depot list (North and South) that applied as of 2026-09-01; the change was recorded in a user-approved operations record dated 2026-10-10 and takes effect 2026-10-15.

Scope note: neither the September summary nor the October record makes any assertion about cold-storage capabilities, so this summary says nothing about them.", "why": "The September summary states transport uses two depots (North and South), while the newer user-approved record dated 2026-10-10 explicitly replaces that list effective 2026-10-15 with North, South and East. The old summary is therefore out of date and should be restated with the new depot list, the effective date, and the retained caveat that cold-storage capabilities are not described.", "evidence": [{"id": "mem_synthetic_stale-summary_0", "quote": "transport uses two depots, North and South"}, {"id": "mem_synthetic_stale-summary_1", "quote": "transport now uses North, South and East depots"}]}

{"kind":"stale-summary","title":"Update Orchard transport depot summary to include East depot from 2026-10-15","body":"**Updated Orchard transport summary (fictional):** As of 2026-10-15, transport uses three depots: North, South and East. This replaces the September 2026 summary listing only North and South depots. No claim about cold-storage capabilities is made by either source; that aspect remains unaddressed and should not be inferred from this summary.

- Earlier summary (as of 2026-09-01): two depots, North and South.
- Later user-approved operations record (dated 2026-10-10): explicitly replaces the September depot list effective 2026-10-15, adding East.","why":"The older summary (mem_synthetic_stale-summary_0) lists only North and South depots as of 2026-09-01. The newer user-approved record (mem_synthetic_stale-summary_1) explicitly replaces that list effective 2026-10-15 with North, South and East. The summary needs updating from this newer evidence while noting the effective date and that cold-storage is not addressed by either source.","evidence":[{"id":"mem_synthetic_stale-summary_0","quote":"transport uses two depots, North and South"},{"id":"mem_synthetic_stale-summary_1","quote":"explicitly replaces the September depot list effective 2026-10-15: transport now uses North, South and East depots"}]}
